#
# File: 100-traceroute-udp-dports33434-out-req-accept.rule
# Title: Allow local traceroute client request to remote traceroute server

# Outbound UDP traceroute request
# Called by: zones/red/inet-filter-output-red-udp.chain
udp dport 33434-33534 accept comment "local-to-remote outbound traceroute request"

